oducts differing in just one entry shows that all \\(\\rho_k\\), and hence all \\(r_i\\), are equal.\n\nConsequently,\n\\[\n\\boxed{f(x)=A(x^2+r)^n,\\qquad A>0,\\quad r>0.}\n\\]\nThese satisfy (2) with equality, by\n\\(\\sum_{j=0}^{n}\\binom nj^2=\\binom{2n}{n}\\).\n\n**If zero is admitted as pure imaginary**, also allow \\(r_i=0\\). Suppose exactly \\(m<n\\) of the \\(r_i\\) are positive. The right side of \\((*)\\) is zero. Since \\(e_j>0\\) exactly when \\(0\\le j\\le m\\), its left side is zero exactly when no integer \\(j\\) satisfies both \\(j\\le m\\) and \\(n-j\\le m\\), i.e. when \\(2m<n\\). Thus the additional solutions are\n\\[\n\\boxed{f(x)=A x^{2(n-m)}\\prod_{i=1}^{m}(x^2+r_i),\n\\quad A>0,\\quad r_i>0,\\quad 0\\le m<\\frac n2.}\n\\]\n\nFinal answer: For nonzero pure imaginary roots, \\(f(x)=A(x^2+r)^n\\) with \\(A,r>0\\); if zero roots are allowed, also include the boxed family with \\(0\\le m<n/2\\)."}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":258,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1500,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":800},"total_tokens":1758},"user":null,"metadata":{}}
